[{"text": "And now I give the floor to his", "start": 1.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "excellency Jaun Aiz Bramov,", "start": 3.2, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Minister for Foreign Affairs of Azer", "start": 6.72, "duration": 4.919}, {"text": "Bjan.", "start": 8.639, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President, Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 33.52, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 37.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "at the outset, I warmly congratulate his", "start": 40.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "excellency Mr. Khalil Rahman on assuming", "start": 43.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the presidency of the 81st session of", "start": 46.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the general assembly and wish him every", "start": 48.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "success in this important position. I", "start": 51.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "also thank his excellency Mr. Antonio", "start": 54.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Gutes, Secretary General of the United", "start": 56.0, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Nations for his endeavors.", "start": 58.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, as global", "start": 61.359, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "challenges become increasingly complex,", "start": 63.6, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "no country can address them alone. And", "start": 66.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "yet the growing limitations of", "start": 68.64, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "multilateral mechanisms continue to", "start": 71.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "undermine our collective ability to", "start": 73.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "respond effectively to current and", "start": 76.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "emerging threats. Meeting these", "start": 79.28, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "realities requires joint action. But", "start": 81.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "true transformation is impossible", "start": 85.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "without first restoring trust in the", "start": 86.88, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "international order and demonstrating", "start": 89.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "that multilateralism can once again", "start": 91.28, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "deliver tangible results for all.", "start": 94.0, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "In an era marked by division, growing", "start": 97.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "intolerance and stark double standards,", "start": 100.799, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Azarbaijan advocates for a reinvigorated", "start": 103.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and reformed multilateral system", "start": 106.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "underpinned by strict atterance to", "start": 108.72, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "consistent and non- selective", "start": 110.88, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "application of universally accepted", "start": 112.56, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "norms and principles of international", "start": 114.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "law. Aarban supports a more effective UN", "start": 117.119, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "capable of delivering tangible results", "start": 121.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "for member states especially in peace", "start": 123.6, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "and security development, climate", "start": 126.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "resilience and humanitarian action", "start": 128.64, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "through inclusive multilateralisms.", "start": 132.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "All states large or small participularly", "start": 135.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "developing countries must have the", "start": 138.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "opportunity to participate equally in", "start": 140.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "global decision making. In this context,", "start": 143.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "reform of the UN security is essential", "start": 146.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "to make it more representative,", "start": 149.28, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "effective, and responsive.", "start": 151.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, restoring global", "start": 154.239, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "trust begins first and foremost with", "start": 156.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "respecting international law, sovereign", "start": 159.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "equality, and peaceful coexistence. It", "start": 161.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "is exactly these principles that are", "start": 165.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "guiding our efforts for peace and", "start": 167.28, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "stability in the south caucuses.", "start": 169.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Even though the decadesl long conflict", "start": 172.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "with Armenia brought immense tragedy to", "start": 174.959, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "our people and left deep scars across", "start": 177.519, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "our land, Azerbaijan has chosen to look", "start": 180.319, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "ahead and turn the page of enmity.", "start": 182.959, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "We offered Armenia peace fully in line", "start": 187.04, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "with norms and principles of", "start": 189.44, "duration": 3.439}, {"text": "international law based on mutual", "start": 190.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "recognition of and respect for each", "start": 192.879, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "other's sovereignty and territorial", "start": 195.04, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "integrity. Our normalization efforts", "start": 197.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "produced historic results at the", "start": 200.159, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Washington peace summit last August", "start": 202.0, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "where the leaders of Aarban and Armenia", "start": 204.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "signed a joint declaration witnessed by", "start": 206.159, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "President Trump of the United States of", "start": 208.8, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "America. Through this declaration, both", "start": 210.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "sides confirmed the end of the conflict", "start": 213.599, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "and their will to jointly chart a", "start": 216.08, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "peaceful and prosperous future. The", "start": 218.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "sides also initial the agreement on", "start": 221.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "establishment of peace and interstate", "start": 223.76, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "relations.", "start": 226.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Today we have achieved the factor peace.", "start": 228.64, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Moreover, by unilaterally lifting", "start": 231.68, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "transit restrictions, Azarbaijan", "start": 233.76, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "facilitates transportation of goods to", "start": 235.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "and from Armenia. We have also", "start": 237.68, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "established bilateral trade. Aarban", "start": 239.76, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "provides strategically important oil", "start": 242.48, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "products to Armenia on a regular basis.", "start": 244.0, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Despite increased volatility in markets", "start": 246.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "and growing international demand for", "start": 248.959, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "these commodities,", "start": 251.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "as we proceed with the peace agenda", "start": 253.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "initiated by Azarbaan, our entire region", "start": 255.76, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "is now turning into a promising anchor", "start": 258.32, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "of stability, connectivity and tangible", "start": 260.959, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "economic dividends.", "start": 263.759, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "To make this process irreversible, it is", "start": 266.08, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "of crucial importance to eliminate the", "start": 268.32, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "remaining obstacle which will allow for", "start": 271.199, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "finalization of the normalization", "start": 273.28, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "process through the signing of the", "start": 274.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "already initial bilateral agreement.", "start": 276.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 280.16, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "complementing the regional normalization", "start": 282.08, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "process, Azarbaijan's postconlict", "start": 283.759, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "rehabilitation agenda aims to ensure", "start": 285.6, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "that hundreds of thousands of", "start": 288.0, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Azerbaijanis can eventually exercise", "start": 289.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "their right to a safe and dignified", "start": 292.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "return to their homes. Due to", "start": 294.96, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "large-scale reconstruction efforts taken", "start": 297.36, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "by the government, life is now returning", "start": 299.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "to our liberated territories. Azarbajan", "start": 301.759, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "is rebuilding the entire region through", "start": 304.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "smart cities and smart villages powered", "start": 306.479, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "by green technology. Areas that were", "start": 308.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "once rubble and ashes are now rising as", "start": 311.199, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "modern settlements. Today, more than", "start": 314.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "90,000 people live, study, and work in", "start": 317.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "the liberated territories.", "start": 320.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Regretfully, a massive contamination of", "start": 323.28, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "the territories of Azerbaijan with", "start": 325.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "landmines and other explosive devices", "start": 327.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "remains a serious obstacle. This", "start": 329.84, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "significantly abstracts the", "start": 332.32, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "reconstruction and return process. Since", "start": 333.44, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "the liberation of occupied territories", "start": 335.919, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "in 2020, more than 400 individuals,", "start": 337.52, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "including women and children, became", "start": 340.8, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "victim to landmines. The cumulative toll", "start": 342.639, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "of landmines over the past 30 years", "start": 345.919, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "exceed 3,500 peoples.", "start": 348.4, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Given the scale of the problem,", "start": 352.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Azarbaijan considers mine action an", "start": 354.16, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "essential prerequisite for fulfilling", "start": 356.88, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "human rights and has formally decreed", "start": 359.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "humanitarian demining its 18th national", "start": 361.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "sustainable development goal. Similarly,", "start": 363.84, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "the need to clarify the fate and", "start": 366.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "whereabouts of nearly 4,000 Azerbaijanis", "start": 368.639, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "who went missing due to the conflict is", "start": 371.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "essential not only for accountability", "start": 374.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "and the rights of the victims and their", "start": 376.88, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "families but also for postconlict", "start": 378.639, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "reconciliation and normalization.", "start": 380.56, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Mr. President, in the face of", "start": 384.319, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "increasingly complex global challenges,", "start": 386.639, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "our collective response must be", "start": 388.8, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "inclusive, equitable, and universal.", "start": 390.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Azarbajan's own experience reflects", "start": 393.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "these principles. Our society is", "start": 395.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "inherently multicultural and", "start": 398.08, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "multiconfessional shaped by centuries of", "start": 400.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "peaceful coexistence of diverse ethnic,", "start": 403.039, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "cultural and religious communities. This", "start": 405.6, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "tradition is reflected in Azarbaijan's", "start": 408.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "international initiatives including the", "start": 410.479, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "world forum on intercultural dialect.", "start": 412.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Launched in 2008 in the framework of the", "start": 415.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Bahu process, the forum has evolved into", "start": 418.0, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "a prominent global platform for", "start": 420.56, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "advancing intercultural dialect and", "start": 422.479, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "cultural diversity, receiving", "start": 424.319, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "international recognition, including", "start": 426.16, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "through a series of United Nations", "start": 428.479, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "General Assembly resolutions.", "start": 430.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Building upon these values, under the", "start": 433.599, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "leadership of the president of the", "start": 436.08, "duration": 2.959}, {"text": "Republic of Azarbajan, his excellency", "start": 437.28, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Mr. Hamaliv Azerbajan has taken", "start": 439.039, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "important steps to strengthen", "start": 441.36, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "international solidarity to build", "start": 442.96, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "bridges and to mobilize collective", "start": 444.96, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "responses.", "start": 447.12, "duration": 3.359}, {"text": "This commitment has also been", "start": 448.639, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "demonstrated through successful hosting", "start": 450.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "and steering of major global gatherings", "start": 452.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "including COP 29 the 13 session of the", "start": 455.84, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "world urban forum results oriented", "start": 458.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "chairmanships of the non-aligned", "start": 460.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "movement the organization of Turk states", "start": 463.44, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "and the conference on interaction and", "start": 465.44, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "confidence building measures in Asia and", "start": 467.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Azarbaijan's increasingly active", "start": 469.84, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "engagement across other international", "start": 472.0, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "platforms", "start": 474.0, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "Azarbaian's full-fledged membership in", "start": 475.52, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "the consultive Meeting of heads of state", "start": 477.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "of Central Asia and the C6 format will", "start": 479.36, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "enhance our contribution to cooperation", "start": 482.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and connectivity within the region and", "start": 484.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "beyond.", "start": 487.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "COP 29 provided a good example of this", "start": 489.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "approach in practice. As host and", "start": 492.72, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "presidency, Azarbaijan guided", "start": 494.96, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "negotiations toward ambitious and", "start": 496.479, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "balanced outcomes while working to", "start": 498.639, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "ensure that all voices were heard. The", "start": 500.96, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "conference delivered several historic", "start": 503.84, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "agreements including the tripling of the", "start": 505.919, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "global climate finance goal, full", "start": 507.919, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "apersonalization of article 6 carbon", "start": 509.919, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "market mechanism and further advancement", "start": 512.32, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "of arrangements supporting the loss and", "start": 514.64, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "damage fund for vulnerable communities", "start": 516.719, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "affected by climate change.", "start": 519.039, "duration": 6.001}, {"text": "Our efforts to advance climate action", "start": 522.32, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "likewise did not end with COP 29.", "start": 525.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Azarbaijan continues to build on its", "start": 527.519, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "legacy with particular focus on", "start": 529.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "translating negotiated outcomes into", "start": 532.0, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "practical implementation. This September", "start": 534.24, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "for the first time Baku hosted the UNF C", "start": 536.959, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "climate week bringing together", "start": 539.519, "duration": 3.201}, {"text": "governments, international", "start": 541.519, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "organizations, the private sector and", "start": 542.72, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "other stakeholders to advance", "start": 544.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "implementation and practical solutions.", "start": 546.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Azarban's commitment to international", "start": 549.68, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "solidarity and cooperation is equally", "start": 551.92, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "reflected in our development and", "start": 553.76, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "humanitarian assistance.", "start": 555.519, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "In recent years, Azarbaijan has", "start": 557.519, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "significantly expanded the scope of its", "start": 559.36, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "international aid with particular", "start": 561.2, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "attention to small island developing", "start": 563.36, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "states and African partner countries.", "start": 565.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Since 2020, we have provided", "start": 567.839, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "humanitarian, economic, and technical", "start": 569.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "assistance, wars, approximately USD 400", "start": 571.76, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "million to more than 140 countries. As", "start": 574.8, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "we mark the 40th anniversary of the", "start": 578.16, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "declaration on the right to development,", "start": 580.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Azarbaijan reaffirms its commitment to", "start": 582.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "partnership based approaches founded on", "start": 585.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "solidarity, mutual respect, and shared", "start": 587.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "development priorities.", "start": 590.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, as we inch closer", "start": 592.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "to 2030, it is becoming even more", "start": 596.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "apparent that the world remains off", "start": 598.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "track in implementing the sustainable", "start": 601.2, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "development goals. Azarbaijan is firmly", "start": 603.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "committed to the 23rd agenda for", "start": 605.6, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "sustainable development having", "start": 607.6, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "integrated the SDGs into its national", "start": 609.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "development strategies, institutional", "start": 611.92, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "frameworks and voluntary national review", "start": 614.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "processes while placing particular", "start": 616.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "emphasis on connectivity, green growth,", "start": 618.959, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "digitalization and sustainable urban", "start": 621.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "development. In less than two decades,", "start": 624.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Azarbaian's GDP has increased three-fold", "start": 626.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "while the poverty rate has declined from", "start": 629.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "49 to around 5%. At the same time,", "start": 632.16, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "Azarbaijan maintains one of the lowest", "start": 635.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "levels of public external debt globally.", "start": 637.839, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "Our commitment also extends to advancing", "start": 642.56, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "sustainable development through", "start": 645.76, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "effective and accountable institutions.", "start": 647.279, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "At Azarbajan's initiative on 30 March", "start": 649.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "2026, the UN Human Rights Council", "start": 652.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "adopted by consensus for the third time", "start": 654.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "the resolution entitled promoting human", "start": 657.279, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "rights and the sustainable development", "start": 660.0, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "goals through transparent, accountable", "start": 662.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "and efficient public service delivery.", "start": 664.16, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Co-sponsored by more than 100 member", "start": 666.56, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "states, the resolution underscores the", "start": 668.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "essential role of citizen- centered,", "start": 671.04, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "transparent, and efficient public", "start": 673.04, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "institutions in advancing human rights", "start": 674.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "and accelerating progress toward the", "start": 676.72, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "SDGs. Azarbaijan's innovative Assan and", "start": 678.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "DOS models of transparent, accessible,", "start": 681.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "and citizen- centered public service", "start": 684.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "delivery have gained international", "start": 686.56, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "recognition and are increasingly being", "start": 688.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "adopted by dozens of partner countries.", "start": 690.64, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Sustainable urbanization is another", "start": 695.44, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "important pillar of our approach to the", "start": 697.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "23rd agenda. Resilient cities are", "start": 699.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "essential to improving quality of life,", "start": 702.16, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "strengthening communities, and promoting", "start": 704.56, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "inclusive economic and social", "start": 706.64, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "development. In this context,", "start": 708.079, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "Azarbaijan's successful hosting of the", "start": 710.399, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "13th session of the World Urban Forum", "start": 712.48, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "marked an important contribution to the", "start": 714.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "global urban agenda. The key outcomes of", "start": 716.399, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "the forum, the Baku call to action and", "start": 719.2, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "the chair summary subsequently", "start": 721.44, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "contributed to the high level meeting of", "start": 723.279, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "the general assembly on midterm review", "start": 725.2, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "of the new urban agenda held in New York", "start": 727.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "in July this year.", "start": 729.839, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "At the same time, environmental", "start": 733.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "protection remains an important national", "start": 735.2, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "and regional priority. We are", "start": 737.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "particularly concerned by continuing", "start": 739.839, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "decline of the Caspian Sea with serious", "start": 741.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "implications for biodiversity,", "start": 744.399, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "livelihoods and economic activity across", "start": 746.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "the region. As a challenge shared by all", "start": 748.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Caspian literal states, it requires a", "start": 751.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "coordinated collective and sustained", "start": 754.959, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "response.", "start": 757.68, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 759.519, "duration": 3.361}, {"text": "while remaining firmly commitment to our", "start": 761.04, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "climate goals, we must also recognize", "start": 762.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "that in the immediate term, development", "start": 765.76, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "cannot realistically proceed without", "start": 768.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "traditional energy sources. Energy", "start": 770.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "security, moreover, is closely", "start": 772.959, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "intertwined with peace, regional", "start": 774.88, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "connectivity, and sustainable economic", "start": 777.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "development. As a reliable natural gas", "start": 778.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "supplier to 16 countries, Azarbaijan", "start": 781.44, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "ranks among the leading pipeline gas", "start": 783.839, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "suppliers globally and plays a strategic", "start": 785.68, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "role in strengthening energy security", "start": 788.16, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "and diversifying supply routes across", "start": 790.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Europe and beyond. Azarban's", "start": 792.959, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "contribution to global energy security", "start": 795.44, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "is increasingly complemented by its", "start": 797.2, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "growing role in the clean energy", "start": 799.36, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "transition. We are investing in", "start": 800.959, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "renewable energy, commissioning major", "start": 803.04, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "solar and wind projects, expanding", "start": 805.12, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "hydroar power capacity and developing", "start": 807.04, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "new clean energy initiative together", "start": 809.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "with leading international partners.", "start": 812.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Agreements already signed and vis around", "start": 814.72, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "6 gawatt of additional solar and wind", "start": 817.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "capacity by 2030.", "start": 819.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "By 2030, renewables are expected to", "start": 821.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "generate almost 40% of Azarbaan's", "start": 824.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "electricity.", "start": 827.279, "duration": 3.441}, {"text": "Expansion of renewable power generation", "start": 828.88, "duration": 3.28}, {"text": "will create new opportunities for", "start": 830.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Azarbaijan to export green electricity", "start": 832.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "to European markets.", "start": 834.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "This way, our role as a reliable energy", "start": 837.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "partner is evolving alongside the global", "start": 840.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "energy transition. Energy connectivity", "start": 842.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "is part of Azarbaijan's broader vision", "start": 845.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "of connecting regions, markets, and", "start": 847.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "economies. Azerbajan has emerged as a", "start": 850.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "key transport and logistics hub between", "start": 852.8, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "Europe and Asia, contributing to major", "start": 854.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "trans regional connectivity initiatives,", "start": 856.959, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "investing in modern transport", "start": 859.04, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "infrastructure and expanding cooperation", "start": 860.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "with regional partners. Since 2022, we", "start": 862.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "have witnessed an increase in cargo", "start": 865.839, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "volumes along the middle corridor by", "start": 867.68, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "almost 90%. Strategic infrastructure", "start": 869.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "projects along the middle corridor", "start": 872.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "speetheaded by Azarbaijan, including the", "start": 874.399, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Baku International Sea Trade Board and", "start": 877.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "the Bakud Bilis cars railway are helping", "start": 879.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "to create more resilient, diversified", "start": 881.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and sustainable supply chains between", "start": 884.24, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Asia and Europe.", "start": 886.8, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "These growths demonstrate the Middle", "start": 889.279, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "Corridor's considerable potential as a", "start": 891.199, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "key driver of regional connectivity,", "start": 893.04, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "trade facilitation, and sustainable", "start": 895.6, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "economic development. Our connectivity", "start": 897.279, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "agenda extends beyond energy and", "start": 900.16, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "transport. Digital connectivity offers", "start": 902.0, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "another important area for regional", "start": 904.399, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "cooperation. Azarbajan is advancing new", "start": 905.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "digital links across the region through", "start": 908.639, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "ambitious initiatives such as a digital", "start": 910.72, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "silkway. This project envisage an", "start": 912.48, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "advanced fiber optic network across the", "start": 915.199, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "Caspian Sea, further strengthening", "start": 916.959, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Azarbai's role as a regional digital hub", "start": 918.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "and a key link between Europe and Asia.", "start": 921.279, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "This broader connectivity agenda is also", "start": 925.12, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "closely linked to the emerging peace", "start": 927.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "architecture in the south caucuses. The", "start": 929.519, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Trump route for international peace and", "start": 932.16, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "prosperity. Another key outcome of the", "start": 933.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "2025 Washington summit is expected to", "start": 936.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "facilitate unimpeded multimodal", "start": 939.6, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "connectivity between the main part of", "start": 941.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Aarban and its Nakuanom Republic and", "start": 943.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "unlock new opportunities for regional", "start": 946.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "trade, economic integration and", "start": 948.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "prosperity as part of the Zanguzur", "start": 950.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "corridor.", "start": 953.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Mr. President, ladies and gentlemen, in", "start": 954.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "conclusion, I wish to reiterate that our", "start": 957.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "shared challenges demand renewed global", "start": 960.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "solidarity, more effective and trusted", "start": 963.519, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "multilateralism grounded in", "start": 965.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "international law and a reinvigorated", "start": 967.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "system of cooperation.", "start": 970.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Trust, however, must be restored through", "start": 972.639, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "concrete actions. Peace must be built on", "start": 975.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the ground. Commitments must be", "start": 978.32, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "translated into real outcomes and", "start": 980.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "sustainable development must deliver", "start": 982.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "meaningful improvements in people's", "start": 985.519, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "life.", "start": 988.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Azarbaian has consistently upheld the", "start": 989.6, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "purposes and principles of the UN", "start": 992.24, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "charter and demonstrated its firm", "start": 994.16, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "adherence to international law including", "start": 996.16, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "respect for sovereignty and territorial", "start": 998.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "integrity non-inference in the internal", "start": 1000.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "affairs of states sovereign equality", "start": 1003.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "dialogue and cooperation as well as the", "start": 1006.079, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "faithful consistent and non- selective", "start": 1009.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "implementation of agreed commitments.", "start": 1011.279, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "This is the multilateralism we believe", "start": 1014.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "in. Principled, inclusive, and above all", "start": 1017.759, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "capable of delivering tangible results.", "start": 1021.44, "duration": 7.479}, {"text": "I thank you.", "start": 1025.439, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": ">> Thank you.", "start": 1029.52, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "I thank the Minister for Foreign Affairs", "start": 1031.36, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "of Azrajan.", "start": 1033.199, "duration": 3.161}]